        "Factorise $(2\\cos\\theta - 1)(\\cos\\theta - 3) = 0$.",
        "Solve $\\cos\\theta = \\frac{1}{2}$ for $\\theta$ in the interval $-90^\\circ < \\theta < 90^\\circ$."
